{"ts":"2026-07-19T04:07:16.881Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"The 100 percent docstring gates (source/exported/member) incentivized mass template docstrings that satisfy coverage while carrying zero information: grep counts 622 'Implements X for the public runtime surface of this module', 2,945 'Value that configures or reports X for this contract' across 135 files, plus 543 'Provides CLI runtime support for X'/'payload exchanged by command, SDK, and package integrations' variants - about 4,100 filler lines. Cost: inflated file length (the 3400-LOC gate deliberately excludes comment lines, but agents reading files still pay the tokens), noise for agent context assembly, and docs that answer nothing (example: ExtensionCommandArgumentHelpDescriptor.name documented as 'Value that configures or reports name for this contract'). This is content-quality simplification under pm-n7rr; distinct from pm-fb3i (coverage floors) and pm-gvnj (DeepSource docs category)."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-dvwm"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Replace template filler docstrings (about 4,100 occurrences) with informative docs and lint against the filler phrases"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":""},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Chore"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":3},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":[]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-19T04:07:16.881Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-19T04:07:16.881Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"maintainer-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":240},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Census script or lint rule flags the known filler templates (Implements X for the public runtime surface of this module; Value that configures or reports X for this contract; Provides CLI runtime support for X; payload exchanged by command, SDK, and package integrations) and the count is ratcheted down, not up; Touched-file burn-down policy documented so gate-mandated docstrings added going forward must carry real information (what the value means, units, invariants) or use @inheritDoc/type-level docs; Static-gate docstring coverage stays at 100 percent throughout - the fix is content quality, never coverage relaxation"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-n7rr"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"low"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":70},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-92if","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-19T04:07:16.881Z"},{"id":"pm-fb3i","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-19T04:07:16.881Z"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"b38d4cafb2d99d050825d464183c638968432c76f846b3315b0e74423022c399","message":""}
